description: Express/Sequelize conventions under src — English identifiers, thin controllers.
globs: src/**/*.js
alwaysApply: false
---

# `src/` conventions

- **English only** for files, symbols, DB, JSON keys, error messages.
- Controllers: map HTTP ↔ use case; use `asyncHandler`.
- Use cases: orchestrate; open transactions when overlap rules require it.
- Repos: always scope by `business_id` on business routes.
- Logger only — no `console.log` for errors.
- File names: kebab-case.
